SUMMARY: Petaluma Trestle Promenade Now - Community Kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Join us in person for the Petaluma Trestle Promenade Now Comm
 unity Kickoff Event.\n\nA dedicated group of local residents has official
 ly launched the Petaluma Trestle Promenade Now Steering Committee. The gr
 oup’s mission is to transform Petaluma’s deteriorating historic trestle i
 nto a vibrant\, iconic riverfront promenade that serves as a community ce
 nterpiece for residents and visitors alike.\n\nLocal residents\, business
  owners\, and community members are invited to attend the official projec
 t kickoff and status update.\n\nRSVP: www.eventbrite.com/e/petaluma-trest
 le-promenade-now-community-kickoff-event-tickets-1989863180338 https://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/petaluma-trestle-promenade-now-community-kickoff-event
 -tickets-1989863180338\n\nLearn more at trestlepromenadenow.org https://t
 restlepromenadenow.org/\n\nQuestions: info@trestlepromenadenow.org mailto
 :info@trestlepromenadenow.org\n\nPicture by Scott Hess
