SUMMARY: Woodstock Uncorked Summer Wine Stroll
DESCRIPTION:Uncork your summer of love & let the good wines roll with an 
 afternoon exploring the eight wine destinations of downtown Petaluma.\n\n
 Welcome to the first ever Petaluma Summer Wine Stroll - a follow up to la
 st December's highly successful Winter Wine Stroll. Explore the eight win
 e tasting rooms and wine bars along the one mile span of downtown Petalum
 a. Each location will be pouring 2-3 of their most popular wines. We have
  also added in two downtown restaurants\, Della Fattoria and Hank's\, to 
 provide you with some satiation along your journey.\n\nThis stroll is Woo
 dstock themed! - We encourage 60's and 70's inspired outfits or flair of 
 any sort.\n\nAll attendees will be divided up among the eight wine busine
 sses for their check-in point. You will begin at one of the assigned loca
 tions to check in and receive your wristband(s) and plastic GoVino glass(
 es).\n\nCHECK-IN POINTS WILL BE EMAILED TO YOU THREE DAYS BEFORE THE EVEN
 T. The master check-in list will be available on this event page three da
 ys before the event as well.\n\n$65 Wristbands. $35 for DD Wristbands.
CATEGORIES:
