DESCRIPTION:Start your evening off right! Join us every Wednesday in June
  for Happy Hour at Adobe Road Winery in Downtown Petaluma. Enjoy special 
 10% off pricing on wines by the glass from 3:30 PM to 5:30 PM. Stop by be
 fore going to dinner\, a movie or show!\n\nEven better\, Inside Track Win
 e Club https://adoberoadwines.com/wine-club/ members enjoy additional clu
