SUMMARY: Music on the Deck ~ Taps on the River
DESCRIPTION:Music on the Deck ~ Taps on the River\n\nLIVE MUSIC THURSDAY\
 n\nTrivia is taking a summer break and we’re kicking off a new chapter at
  Taps with live music on the river.\n\nJoin us Thursdays all summer for m
 usic on the deck from 7p-9p. Cold beers. River views. Sunset vibes. Live 
 music. Sounds like summer in Petaluma.\n\n-------------------------------
 ---\n\n\nDate: Thursday\, June 11\n\nTime: 7p-9p\n\nBand: Campbells Jazz 
 Soup Trio\n\nGrab a seat\, order your favorite drink\, and settle in for 
 an evening of smooth jazz\, soulful grooves\, and good vibes on the deck.
  Expect a flavorful blend of jazz standards\, swing\, blues\, and laid-ba
 ck summer sounds—perfectly paired with a riverfront sunset and a cold bev
 erage. No cover. Just great music\, great company\, and a little jazz for
  the soul.\n\nLocation: Taps on the River\n\nAll Music Dates (Thursdays):
  June ~ 4\, 11\, 18\, 25 July ~ 2\, 9\, 16\, 23\, 30 August ~ 6\, 13\, 20
 \, 27 September ~ 3\, 10\, 17\, 24 October ~ 1\, 8\, 15\, 22\, 29\n\n~ Ro
 tating Performers ~ Check by Date! ~\n\n\nInfo: https://www.facebook.com/
 events/930868406578978/930868413245644/?acontext=%7B%22event_action_histo
