SUMMARY: A Night of Retro Soul\, Funk\, and Boogie at Brooks Note Winery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Night of Retro Soul\, Funk\, and Boogie featuri
 ng E. Live and Chesta\, Velvet Shadows and DJ Gamayabreak at Brooks Note 
 Winery!\n\nThere will be live sets from E. Live and Chesta Blake and Velv
 et Shadows. DJ Gamayabreak (AKA our assistant winemaker\, Reid Kinnett) w
 ill open the evening with an eclectic mix of soul and funk and conclude i
 t with some high energy boogie and disco.\n\nE. Live and Chesta Blake are
  a retro-styled dance duo playing original music from their vinyl release
 s on Star Creature Records\, along with creative new takes on 80's classi
 cs.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W8p9aNPE1qk https://link.commerce7
