 Lf_8onKbsxsk_-5Ouj4ww\n\nDJ Gamayabreak is a Santa Rosa based DJ who play
 s an eclectic mix of psych\, afrobeat\, brazilian\, jazz\, funk\, and dis
 co exclusively on vinyl. He has performed locally at Bloodroot Winery\, S
 hady Oak Brewing\, and is a regular in the rotation of DJs at Glitter and
  Goth\, a monthly dance club in Santa Rosa.
