SUMMARY: Theatre District Summer Concert Series – Timothy O’Neil
DESCRIPTION:Theatre District is thrilled to announce the return of its Su
 mmer Concert Series for 2026. Beginning in June and running through Septe
 mber\, the series features free live music every Friday from 6:00 PM to 8
 :00 PM in downtown Petaluma. The concert series brings together local tal
 ent and diverse musical styles\, creating a vibrant community gathering i
 n the heart of the Theatre District.\n\nTimothy O’Neil https://www.timoth
 yoneilband.com/ is performing from 6:00 to 8:00 in Theatre Square. We hop
 e to see you there!\n\nTimothy O’Neil\, a prominent musician in Petaluma\
 , California\, has carved out a niche in the local Americana scene with h
 is distinctive blend of punk rock\, bluegrass\, folk\, and singer-songwri
 ter influences. Originally hailing from Temecula\, California\, O’Neil’s 
 music is known for its raw energy and heartfelt storytelling. His band\, 
 the Timothy O’Neil Band\, delivers dynamic performances that blend energe
 tic steam-punk anthems with soulfully honest folk ballads\, creating a un
 ique sound that resonates with a wide audience. O’Neil’s songwriting ofte
 n reflects his diverse influences\, and his live shows are marked by an e
 ngaging presence that invites audience participation .
CATEGORIES:Summer-Concert-Series,Theatre-District,Music,Live-Music
